{"words": [{"text": "رَبَّنَا", "translation": "Our Lord"}, {"text": "وَٱبْعَثْ", "translation": "[And] raise up"}, {"text": "فِيهِمْ", "translation": "in them"}, {"text": "رَسُولًۭا", "translation": "a Messenger"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "يَتْلُوا۟", "translation": "(who) will recite"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِكَ", "translation": "Your Verses"}, {"text": "وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ", "translation": "and will teach them"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ", "translation": "and the wisdom"}, {"text": "وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "and purify them"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "You (are)"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translation": "the All-Mighty"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَكِيمُ", "translation": "the All-Wise"}], "sahih": "Our Lord, and send among them a messenger from themselves who will recite to them Your verses and teach them the Book and wisdom and purify them. Indeed, You are the Exalted in Might,1 the Wise.\""}